  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Asian Development Bank Article 6 Support Facility</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The A6SF aims to assist ADB&#x2019;s Developing Member Countries to participate, voluntarily, in&#xa0;carbon markets in line with Article 6 of the Paris Agreement. It&#xa0;provides technical, capacity-building, and policy-development support to countries to enhance their readiness capacity and preparedness to take advantage of international carbon markets and secure sustainable development co-benefits. New Zealand&apos;s contribution is ringfenced&#xa0;for eligible ASEAN countries.</narrative>
  </description>
